    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>&quot;A graph defines the computational logic of a model and is comprised of a parameterized &quot; &quot;list of nodes that form a directed acyclic graph based on their inputs and outputs. This &quot; &quot;is the equivalent of the &apos;network&apos; or &apos;graph&apos; in many deep learning frameworks.&quot; <linebreak/>
 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
